test/check/error-init-values.sumspec:6:19:
  |
6 | __init :: App(Mode' * Label(Text#t) * x * Items[i](Mode.On) * Count)
  |                   ^
the initial state has no old value, so nothing in it takes a prime ('); write Mode without one

test/check/error-init-values.sumspec:6:34:
  |
6 | __init :: App(Mode' * Label(Text#t) * x * Items[i](Mode.On) * Count)
  |                                  ^
the initial state takes no input, so it names no value; remove #t

test/check/error-init-values.sumspec:6:39:
  |
6 | __init :: App(Mode' * Label(Text#t) * x * Items[i](Mode.On) * Count)
  |                                       ^
the initial state takes no input, so there's no value named x to use

test/check/error-init-values.sumspec:6:43:
  |
6 | __init :: App(Mode' * Label(Text#t) * x * Items[i](Mode.On) * Count)
  |                                           ^
the initial state takes no input, so an element path can't pick an element; write Items

test/check/error-init-values.sumspec:6:63:
  |
6 | __init :: App(Mode' * Label(Text#t) * x * Items[i](Mode.On) * Count)
  |                                                               ^
Count is not a factor of App (Mode * Label * Items * Missing)

test/check/error-init-values.sumspec:8:30:
  |
8 | App = Mode * Label * Items * Missing
  |                              ^
unknown type Missing; declare it in __atomics or define it

